                         style="font-family: var(--font-serif);"
                       >
                         {step.body}
                       </p>
                     </div>
                   </li>
                 );
               })}
             </ol>

             {/* Mid-page CTA — the reader has just seen the whole process. */}
           </section>

           {/* ── Closing CTA ── */}
           <section class="mt-20 md:mt-28">
